.PP
.RS "4"
.nf
epx ai jobs [flags]
epx ai jobs [command]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Reads the jobs of the AI Service: TYPE is AGENT_CHAT (an agent\(aqs run), IMPORT or EXPORT (of agents), STATUS in_progress, success, failure or skipped, AGENT and SESSION the agent that ran and its session (\fBepx ai logs sessions get\fR) and EVENT the commerce event that started it. The agent\(aqs message and an import\(aqs or export\(aqs result are only in \fB\-o json\fR.
.PP
Its reads require the ai.agent_read scope. Its writes require the ai.agent_manage scope.
.SS "epx ai jobs delete"
