Read which fields the AI RAG Indexer embeds and filters by; reindex.
.PP
.RS "4"
.nf
epx ai rag [flags]
epx ai rag [command]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Reads the AI RAG Indexer, which embeds the entities of a type in a vector database for the retrieval\-augmented generation (RAG) tools of agents: the fields it can embed and those a vector search can filter by; and embeds the entities of a type again.
.PP
Its reads require the ai.agent_read scope. Its writes require the ai.agent_manage scope.
.SS "epx ai rag fields"
List the fields of an entity type that can be embedded for RAG search.
.PP
.RS "4"
.nf
epx ai rag fields TYPE [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Reads the fields of an entity type, by path, that the AI RAG Indexer can embed. TYPE is PRODUCT, ORDER, CUSTOMER or LEGAL\-ENTITY in any case, or a custom entity type, whose ID \fBepx custom\-entities list\fR shows. LEGAL\-ENTITY takes a hyphen, not an underscore. An unknown TYPE, such as LEGAL_ENTITY, gets 400 Bad Request (exit 1). The fields come whole, so they are read with one request.
.PP
Requires the ai.agent_read scope.
.PP
\fBOptions:\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-columns <names>\fR
Print only these columns of table and csv, in this order: comma\-separated names (any case) among FIELD.
.TP
\fB\-\-limit <n>\fR
Print at most n items; paged reads stop early where they safely can (0: every item).
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-headers\fR
Print table and csv without the header row.
.TP
