.SS "epx ai rag filter\-fields"
List the fields of an entity type that a vector search can filter by.
.PP
.RS "4"
.nf
epx ai rag filter\-fields TYPE [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Reads the fields of an entity type, by path, that a vector search can filter by before RAG retrieval, with their data type in the TYPE column (string, integer, float, boolean, datetime, date, time, dictionary, list or object). PARENT is the path of the list of objects a field sits in, such as addresses, and empty outside a list; tables cut a long PARENT. A schema\(aqs REFERENCE attribute comes as two fields, its path (object) and that path with .id (string), the one to filter by. TYPE is PRODUCT, ORDER, CUSTOMER or LEGAL\-ENTITY in any case, or a custom entity type, whose ID \fBepx custom\-entities list\fR shows. LEGAL\-ENTITY takes a hyphen, not an underscore. An unknown TYPE, such as LEGAL_ENTITY, gets 400 Bad Request (exit 1). The fields come whole, so they are read with one request.
.PP
Requires the ai.agent_read scope.
.PP
\fBOptions:\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-columns <names>\fR
