.SS "epx ai rag reindex"
Embed every entity of a type again for RAG search (deprecated by Emporix).
.PP
.RS "4"
.nf
epx ai rag reindex TYPE [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Embeds every entity of a type again in the vector database, replacing its records there; it sends no body. Emporix has deprecated this endpoint in favor of a reindex job: \fBepx indexing reindex\-jobs create\fR, which \fB\-\-wait\fR follows. Give it \fB\-\-rag\fR for PRODUCT; for CUSTOMER and LEGAL\-ENTITY, the job updates their embeddings without it. TYPE is PRODUCT, ORDER, CUSTOMER or LEGAL\-ENTITY in any case, or a custom entity type, whose ID \fBepx custom\-entities list\fR shows. LEGAL\-ENTITY takes a hyphen, not an underscore. Emporix has answered an unknown TYPE with 204 No Content (exit 0), not the 400 Bad Request its reference gives, so check the TYPE first.
