.TP
\fB\-o, \-\-output <format>\fR
Format of the response: json or yaml. Default: \fBjson\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Send without asking (required without a terminal).
.PP
\fBExamples:\fR
.PP
.RS "4"
.nf
epx ai rag reindex PRODUCT \-\-dry\-run
.fi
.RE
